ins":0.2456,"summary":"Purple Wave Infocom Limited designs, integrates, manages, and supports on site and cloud-based communication and automation solutions. The company offers value-added services through cloud-based communication and automation platforms; and live streaming and digital content management services under a software-as-a-service. It also engages in the direct selling and distribution of various professional AV products, including indoor and outdoor active LED screens, professional display screens, digital signage solutions, electronics shelf labels, digital podiums, audio video conferencing systems, unified communication devices, professional speakers and amplifiers, and hearing assistive devices; mounts, cables, and accessories; processors, media players, and control systems. In addition, the company provides after-sales support services, including annual maintenance contracts (AMC), technical support, repair and maintenance services. Further, it offers touch and non-touch displays, digital kiosks, and mounts and accessories, as well as consultancy, solution design, project management, and support services. The company serves corporate, education, government collaboration, home AV, and digital signage sectors under the Streampurple, Saipur, Nano Theater, and The IVY brands. Purple Wave Infocom Limited was incorporated in 2007 and is based in New Delhi, India.","employees":83,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795613646},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795613646,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Purple Wave Infocom\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Purple Wave Infocom Ltd. 52 Week High Streak and Valuation","s":"Univest","d":1795461459,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNQVFaM1FqczVJa3F4bGxyV3VoOE01YU5ZaG15N1FfMUZtbDVmTzhxTkJnREp2cEdUNmpvNllBVVdYVWFwUFBZY2VNZlg3Q2otZWppQjBDUlJOdVd3M3RuM29nVUdEMDhjRUQ1dVMwakkyQUJBZzlDdHhMNTktbkhJSFpqaUowQm